</P1>
<P1 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1995/2992/article/4/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/1995/2992/article/4" id="article-4">
<Pnumber>4</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<Text>The Chief Electoral Officer for Northern Ireland shall make such re-arrangement or adaptation of the register of parliamentary electors as may be necessary to give effect to this Order.</Text>
</P1para>
